  "title": "Winterizing a Boat: What you Need to Know",
  "summary": "Where do you live? Are you in a state that gets chilly in the winter? Do temps dip down below zero mid-January leaving you dreaming of the boating season? Is your hometown known for the hot sun and warm temps? If you’ve answered yes to any of these questions, chances are, you will need to winterize your boat at some point throughout its lifetime.",
